---
import Layout from '~/layouts/main.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Tackbok';
const description = "Learn how Tackbok handles your data. Your journal entries stay on your device — we don't collect or store them.";
const lastUpdated = 'March 13, 2026';
const supportEmail = 'tackbok.support@mehra.dev';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <main
    class="flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center bg-background p-6 text-foreground sm:p-12 lg:p-24"
  >
    <div class="flex w-full max-w-3xl flex-col gap-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:underline"
      >
        &larr; Back to Home
      </a>

      <div>
        <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Last updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">
        <p>
          At <strong>Mehra Dot Dev</strong>, we believe in transparency and honesty. We hope you will find this privacy policy clear and transparent. Do not hesitate to reach out to us at <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}><strong>{supportEmail}</strong></a> if you have any questions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Data Collection &amp; Usage</h2>
        <p>
          The <strong>Tackbok</strong> application does not require you to create an account. Therefore, we neither store nor have access to your personal entries and data remotely. Your data is stored locally on your device, and all data processing is done locally.
        </p>
        <p>
          We obtain your email address only when you explicitly request support via email. We use your email strictly to contact you to provide support, feedback, or important information.
        </p>
        <p>
          Additionally, Tackbok features a donation system. Donations are processed via RevenueCat. When making a donation, you may choose to provide a display name (or remain anonymous) and an optional email address. The display name will be shown on our public donation leaderboard (where the top 3 donors of the past 90 days are highlighted at the top, and all other donors are listed below). If you provide an email address, it will be used solely to send you a donation acknowledgment and a thank-you note. Your email address will never be publicly displayed on the leaderboard.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Google Drive Backup (Optional)</h3>
        <p>
          Tackbok offers an optional feature that allows you to securely back up and sync your journal entries across devices using your own <strong>Google Drive</strong> account. If you choose to enable this feature, the application will request access to your Google Drive strictly to upload and retrieve your backup files.
        </p>
        <p>
          We want to be absolutely clear: <strong>we (the developers) do not have any access to your Google Drive data, your journal entries, or your backup files.</strong> All data is transferred directly between your device and your personal Google Drive account. We do not store your Google Drive credentials or any journal data on our servers, nor do we share your Google user data with any third parties. This integration is provided solely for your convenience to keep your data safe.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>PostHog</strong> to collect and analyze anonymized usage data and crash reports to understand usage patterns, diagnose issues, and improve our application. The application does not collect any personal data that directly identifies you, such as your name, email, or anything you type within the app.
        </p>
        <p>
          The analytics service automatically collects certain information that does not personally identify our end users, such as device state information, unique device identifiers, device hardware and OS information, or anonymized IP addresses.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>We do not sell your personal data.</strong> Any data that is transmitted from your device to our third-party service providers (such as PostHog or RevenueCat) is used strictly to provide, maintain, and improve the app's functionality (e.g., processing donations and analyzing app usage). We do not share your information with any third parties for their own marketing or advertising purposes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Additionally, the <strong>Tackbok</strong> application is completely ad-free. We do not display any advertisements within the app, nor do we collect data to build advertising profiles.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          We currently use the following third-party services for our app:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>PostHog</strong>: This service helps us collect and analyze anonymized usage data and crash reports to improve our app. For more information, please view the <a href="https://posthog.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-4">PostHog Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>RevenueCat</strong>: This service manages and processes in-app purchases and donations. For more information, please view the <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-4">RevenueCat Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Drive (Optional)</strong>: If you enable cloud backups, the app interacts with the Google Drive API to securely store and retrieve your data on your personal Google account. For more information, please view the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-4">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes we may make to our privacy policy in the future will be posted on this page. You are advised to check this page from time to time and take note of any changes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight border-t border-border pt-4">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding privacy while using the Application, or have questions about our practices, please contact us via email at <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}><strong>{supportEmail}</strong></a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
